        "TileImage": "$($repository cb1cd30b-cdad-4b41-8036-568dad9ce1ba).Image",
        "Description": "Our client is a certain Theodore Kohn, of Morgan, Yates &amp; Kohn. It seems they&apos;ve hired us to clean up after their partner&apos;s mess. It seems that our targets, Mrs. Barat and Mr. Kaplan, need to be taken care of. Barat with damning evidence against their key client, and Mr. Kaplan is suspected of double-crossing the firm and plans to share more evidence with Barat. You know what to do. \r\rGood luck, 47.",
